1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,914
Eta is the coefficient of viscosity, the force per unit area per unit velocity gradient.

2
00:00:06,914 --> 00:00:11,809
Its unit is newton second per metre squared, or pascal second.

3
00:00:11,809 --> 00:00:14,791
One pascal second is ten poise.

4
00:00:14,791 --> 00:00:18,815
The minus sign shows that the force opposes the sliding.

